# Execution Plan — T-152-010: MCP 8 Resource Fetch Test

## Scope
READ-ONLY audit. Deliverable: `docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-010-mcp-resources.md`

## Steps
1. Read MCP server source (src/mcp/server.ts or similar) to find resource handlers
2. Map 8 resources: dashboard, directives, memory, debt, config, retro, tasks, agents
3. For each resource: identify content type, generation logic, freshness source, size
4. Invoke MCP server via JSON-RPC stdio for `resources/list` + `resources/read`
5. Compare: CLI-equivalent output vs MCP resource output for parity
6. Report: MIME type, content freshness, byte size, error handling per resource

## No code changes. Only audit report write.
